Let \[f(x) =
\begin{cases}
|\lfloor{x}\rfloor| &\text{if }x\text{ is rational}, \\
\lceil{x}\rceil^2 &\text{if }x\text{ is irrational}.
\end{cases}
\] Find $f(\sqrt[3]{-8})+f(-\pi)+f(\sqrt{50})+f\left(\frac{9}{2}\right)$. Show that it is 79.

